
<p>Sora, on Twitter/X:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>We’re saying goodbye to the Sora app. To everyone who created with
Sora, shared it, and built community around it: thank you. What
you made with Sora mattered, and we know this news is
disappointing.</p>

<p>We’ll share more soon, including timelines for the app and API and
details on preserving your work.</p>
</blockquote>

<p>Sora was kind of fun for a week or two. But, contrary to the above, nothing anyone made with Sora mattered. It was just a very (very) expensive lark.</p>

